	en: {
		title: "Why HER TREES Feels Different - Observation-Driven Puzzle Design",
		description: "Discover what makes HER TREES unique: non-verbal puzzles, hand-drawn black-and-white art, and intuition-based gameplay. A deep dive into the design philosophy.",
		pageHeading: "Why HER TREES Feels Different",
		pageIntro:
			"The strength of HER TREES is not complexity for its own sake. It is the way the games ask players to understand pictures, order, and spatial relationships without over-explaining them.",
